<div class="Section1" style="vsb_temp: 15.6pt;">
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 22pt;"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">为进一步推动学校国际交流与合作，提升学校国际化水平，加大对一流学科建设的支持，学校决定面向教学科研人员、优秀在读研究生设立并实施西安电子科技大学师生“双一流”海外研修项目（以下简称“项目”）。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">具体实施方案见附件<span lang="EN-US">3</span>，现将研究生申报该项目相关事项通知如下：</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: -36pt; margin-left: 36pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">一、<span style="font: 7pt/normal &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;">&nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">选派对象</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: 0cm; margin-left: 36pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">全体全日制在读研究生</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: -36pt; margin-left: 36pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">二、<span style="font: 7pt/normal &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;">&nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">选派类别</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">联合培养博士研究生，留学期限为<span lang="EN-US">6-24</span>个月；</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">联合培养硕士研究生，留学期限为<span lang="EN-US">3-12</span>月。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: -36pt; margin-left: 36pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">三、<span style="font: 7pt/normal &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;">&nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">申请条件</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: -21pt; margin-left: 21pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">(一)<span style="font: 7pt/normal &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">基本条件</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 26pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">1.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">申请人应具有中华人民共和国国籍，不具有国外永久居留权。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 26pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">拥护中国共产党的领导和中国特色社会主义道路，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">热爱祖国，具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，身心健康，无违法违纪记录<span lang="EN-US">,</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">具有服务国家、服务社会、服务人民的责任感和端正的世界观、人生观、价值观。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 26pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">申请人应具备扎实的专业基础和发展潜力，较强的学习能力、科研能力和交流能力，综合素质良好，工作业绩突出，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">具有学成回国为国家建设服务的事业心和使命感</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 26pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">4.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">符合出国学习的外语条件及学习国家、学习单位的语言要求。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: -21pt; margin-left: 21pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">(二)<span style="font: 7pt/normal &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">联合培养研究生申请时年龄原则不超过<span lang="EN-US">35</span>周岁，申请</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: 0cm;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">人原则上应已完成学位论文开题工作，出国学习计划应紧密结合学位论文工作。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: -21pt; margin-left: 21pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">(三)<span style="font: 7pt/normal &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">暂不受理以下人员的申请：</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: -18pt; margin-left: 39pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">1.<span style="font: 7pt/normal &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;">&nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">已获得国外全额奖学金资助；</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: -18pt; margin-left: 39pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2.<span style="font: 7pt/normal &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;">&nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">已获得国家公派研修资格且在有效期内；</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: -18pt; margin-left: 39pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">3.<span style="font: 7pt/normal &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;">&nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">已申报国家公派<span lang="EN-US">/</span>学校公派出国研修项目尚未公布录取结果。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: 0cm;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">（四）其他要求详见附件<span lang="EN-US">3</span>。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: -36pt; margin-left: 36pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">四、<span style="font: 7pt/normal &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;">&nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">资助标准</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: -36pt; margin-left: 36pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;"></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">学校设立专项经费资助研究生出国研修，资助额度不低</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">于国家规定的有关标准，资助内容包括一次性往返国际旅费，研修期间生活费，详见附件<span lang="EN-US">3</span>。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: -36pt; margin-left: 36pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">五、<span style="font: 7pt/normal &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;">&nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">报名材料</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: 0cm;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">1.</span> <span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">西安电子科技大学“双一流”海外研修项目申请表（研究生）<strong>（<span lang="EN-US">pdf</span>）</strong></span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">请校内导师、学院签字盖章后扫描为<span lang="EN-US">pdf</span>格式。（校内导师以学籍系统为准，外方导师须为国外高校全职导师）</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: 0cm;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">主要学术成果汇总表</span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">（<span lang="EN-US">excel</span>）</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">及相应证明材料</span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">（<span lang="EN-US">pdf</span>）</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">请严格按照附件<span lang="EN-US">2.</span>主要学术成果汇总表<strong>（<span lang="EN-US">excel</span>）</strong>模板要求填写，并附带相应证明材料（包括但不限于已发表学术论文的刊物封面、目录及论文首页复印件，专著封面和版权页复印件，获奖证书及专利证书复印件），研究生院将用于校内评审。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: 0cm;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">国外院校邀请函</span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">（<span lang="EN-US">pdf</span>）</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">格式无严格要求，需要外方导师签字确认，研究生院将用于校内评审。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: 0cm;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">4.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">外方导师简介</span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">（<span lang="EN-US">pdf</span>）</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">格式无严格要求，包含外方导师主要学术成果，需要外方导师签字确认，研究生院将用于校内评审。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: 0cm;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">5.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">外语水平证明</span><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">（<span lang="EN-US">pdf</span>）</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">包括但不限于全国英语等级考试、全国外语水平考试、雅思、托福、达到国外拟研修单位语言要求（可在外方邀请函中注明或单独出具证明），研究生院将用于校内评审。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: -36pt; margin-left: 36pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">六、<span style="font: 7pt/normal &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;">&nbsp; </span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">时间安排</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: 0cm;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">1.7</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">月<span lang="EN-US">17</span>日<span lang="EN-US">-8</span>月<span lang="EN-US">31</span>日 &nbsp;&nbsp;学生报名至学院</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: 0cm;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2.9</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">月<span lang="EN-US">1</span>日<span lang="EN-US">-9</span>月<span lang="EN-US">4</span>日<span lang="EN-US">&nbsp; </span>学院检查申请材料无误后交至研究生院</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: 0cm;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2.9</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">月<span lang="EN-US">4</span>日<span lang="EN-US">-9</span>月<span lang="EN-US">30</span>日 研究生院组织专家评审，公示并确定入选名单</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: 0cm;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">3.10</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">月<span lang="EN-US">1</span>日<span lang="EN-US">- &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>入选人员办理出访手续，派出</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: 0cm;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="line-height: 26pt; text-indent: -36pt; margin-left: 36pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">七、<span style="font: 7pt/normal &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: normal;">&nbsp; </span></span><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">报名方式</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 26pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">请各位同学将电子版申请材料存入一个文件夹并命名为<strong>姓名<span lang="EN-US">-</span>学号</strong>（例如：张三<span lang="EN-US">-20231111111</span>）交至学院，请各学院检查核对申请材料无误后汇总附件<span lang="EN-US">2.</span>学生主要成果汇总表于<strong><span lang="EN-US">9</span>月<span lang="EN-US">1</span>日至<span lang="EN-US">9</span>月<span lang="EN-US">4</span>日一并</strong>打包发送至邮箱<span lang="EN-US">tongzhang@xidian.edu.cn</span>。<strong>学生个人申请不予受理</strong>，纸质版报名材料各学院自行留存。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 26pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 26pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">附件：</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 26pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">1.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">西安电子科技大学师生“双一流”海外研修项目申请表（研究生）</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 26pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">主要学术成果汇总表</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 26pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">西安电子科技大学师生</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">双一流</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">海外研修项目实施办法（请于国合部官网下载<span lang="EN-US">https://oice.xidian.edu.cn/content.jsp?urltype=news.NewsContentUrl&amp;wbtreeid=1011&amp;wbnewsid=11233</span>）</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 26pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 26pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 26pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 26pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 26pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 26pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 26pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">研究生院</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">2023</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">年<span lang="EN-US">7</span>月<span lang="EN-US">17</span>日</span></p>
</div>
</div></p>
 </div>
