            <li>附件【<a href="/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1281831001&wbfileid=FDF9E7EA413B623DA43FC9AD165B798E" target="_blank">附件1.西安电子科技大学师生“双一流”海外研修项目申请表（研究生）.docx</a>】<!--已下载<span id="nattach6658580" ><script language=javascript>getClickTimes(6658580,1281831001,"wbnewsfile","attach")</script></span>次--></li>
